      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Diamagnetic Y(III) leaves two isolated Mn(III) ions. χmT at 300 K is 6.2 emu K mol−1 (calcd 6.0). Fitting including Mn(III) ZFS gave g = 2.03(1), |D| = 7.0(3) cm−1, zJ' = 0.07(1) cm−1. Magnetization at 2 K is below the Brillouin curve for two S = 2 Mn(III) ions; Anisofit gave D = 7.3 cm−1. No slow magnetic relaxation. Weiss constant θ = −0.56 K; M(2 K, 5 T) = 6.45 Nβ.",
        "measurements": [
